        <p>return game has been arranged for Wednesday. July 21st, when Rylands's Recreation hope to reverse Wednesday's result. Scores:— Lord Derby's Hospital—Walker c McGowan b Carter 5, Handworth b McGowan 33. Dawson c McGowan b Lemon 26, Spicer c Duckworth. b Lemon 14, Smith c Renwick b Lemon 5, Co1.(1- bourn not out 49, Dr. Anderson b Lemon 3C. Kermode b Lemon 0, Lieut. Richardson lbw b Lemon 0, Swort b Lemon 0, Trounson c and b Lemon 13, extras 5; total 166. Lemon took 8 wickets for 44 runs.</p>
        <p>Rylands's Recreation C.C.—Lemon b Dr. ..knder son 13, Knight b Smith 0, McGowan c Hand- worth b Smith 6, Carter b Smith 2, Saunders Smith 14, Renwick st. "Bronko " b Smith S. Duckworth c Handworth b Dr. Anderson 1. Phenix b Dr. Anderson 6, Hare not out 0, Plc. Emmen b Dr. Anderson 2, Pte. Eards c Dawson b Dr. Anderson 0, extras 8; total 60.</p>
