        <p>BRIDGE.—On June 25th. at 2, Battersby-lane Richard, eldest son of the late Joseph Bridge, of Warrington. MILLER.—On June 24th, at 21, Albert-terrace, George Miller, aged 75 years. PITCHFORD.—On June 28th. at 20, Stanley-street, Ebenezer Pitchford, aged 59 years. TlitllEß.—On July _lst, at 707, Knutsford-road,</p>
        <p>_ El4ie Turner, aged 20 years. WARBURTON.—On June 24th, at 23, Orford-street, Charlotte Warburton, aged 26 years.</p>
