        <p>Acknowledgments.</p>
        <p>,LIRS-. C. WORTHINGTON (daughter of the late Mr. Richard Bridge) desires to THANK all friends for their kindness and expressions of sympathy in her recent sad bereavement; and also those who sent floral tributes.</p>
        <p>MR. WM. NEVirNS, 16, Forshavr-street, 1%1. desires to THANK numerous friends for ex- pressions of sympathy in his loss of two sons, killed at the Front.</p>
