      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-07-03_WidnesExaminer_art0306" n="art0306">
        <head>SHEPHERDS' M UN.</head>
        <p>SHEPHERDS' M UN.</p>
        <p>The green of the Walker's Brewery Recreation Club, Arpley, was in first-class -condition on Saturday for the Loyal Order of Ancient Shep- herds' main. Bro.. Peter L. Edgar and a hard- working committee made every provision, but war conditions told against a heavy entry. Details:—</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-07-03_WidnesExaminer_art0307" n="art0307">
        <head>First Round</head>
