        <p>DON'T LOON OLD.—Keep the ravages of time at bay by darkening the grey streaks with LocacyEn's SULPHUR HAIR REsToiticit, which deepens to a natural colour in a few days Lockyer's maintains a youthful appearance. Large hot's' wary 'there. Post freell6 Bedford Laboratorys London; 8.8</p>
