        <p>PRIVATE D. CLAYTON, 17, Guardian-street, had his left elbow half blown away. lie is 48 years of age and married. Was in the Volunteer and Wycliffe bands.</p>
        <p>PRIVATE CAI. ASHTON. Private Charles Henry Ashton, 31, Cartwright- street, is wounded in the head and right shoulder. A native of Penketh, aud a labourer in the eletrical departuieut at Crolield's,</p>
